abel here&#39;</span><span style=\"color:#001b93\">)</span></div> </div><div><br></div>Cheers<div>david.</div><div><br><div><div>On Jan 19, 2011, at 5:39 PM, Andrew Redd wrote:</div><br><blockquote type=\"cite\"><div>using the example on the website as a reference.<br><br>library(ggplot2)<br> qplot(factor(cyl), data=mtcars, geom=&quot;bar&quot;, fill=factor(cyl))<br><br>How do I change the label of the legend?<br><br>Thanks,<br>Andrew<br><br>-- <br>You received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br> Please provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"http://gist.github.com/270442\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gist.github.com/270442&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792380851320000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yvcR0yd2ef4kjS095bfTa\">http://gist.github.com/270442</a><br><br>To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br> To unsubscribe: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggplot2+u...@googlegroups.com</a><br>More options: <a href=\"http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792380851320000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1hOhLW27mZUHtI_ecoGDWc\">http://groups.google.com/group/ggplot2</a><br> </div></blockquote></div><br></div><div><br></div> -- <br> You received this message because you are subscribed to the ggplot2 mailing list.<br> Please provide a reproducible example: <a href=\"http://gist.github.com/270442\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://gist.github.com/270442&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792380851320000&amp;usg=AOvVaw3yvcR0yd2ef4kjS095bfTa\">http://gist.github.com/270442</a><br>  <br> To post: email <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">ggp...@googlegroups.com</a><br> To unsubscribe: email <a href dat